<user_provided_header>
ClariFin_OS - Personal Finance Tracker Monorepo (Source Code Only: Python + TypeScript)

ARCHITECTURE:
- Backend: Python 3.11+ FastAPI with SQLAlchemy 2.0, Pydantic v2, Alembic migrations
- Frontend: Next.js 14 (App Router) + TypeScript 5, React 18, Tailwind CSS, Radix UI
- Database: SQLite (dev) / PostgreSQL (prod) with async SQLAlchemy

KEY DIRECTORIES:
- backend/src/ - 31 routers, 33 services, 28 repositories, 16 financial engines, 12 extraction modules (.py)
- frontend/app/ - 19 route directories (app router) (.tsx)
- frontend/components/ - 42 component directories (.tsx)
- frontend/lib/ - 38 library directories (.ts)
- scripts/ - bootstrap, launch, verify, migration scripts (.sh, .py)

CONFIGURATION (kept for context):
- pyproject.toml: Python dependencies, tool config (ruff, mypy, pytest)
- package.json: Node dependencies, scripts
- tsconfig.json: TypeScript config
- next.config.ts: Next.js config
- requirements*.txt: Python deps
- .env.example: environment template

EXCLUDED:
- runtime/ folder (verification runtime)
- All generated/, binary assets, lock files, vendor bundles
- All markdown docs (README.md kept for project overview)
- All CI/CD workflows, .github/
- AGENTS.md, .clinerules, CHANGELOG.md, LICENSE, etc.
- Cache, build outputs, test artifacts, database files
</user_provided_header>

